{%- doc -%}
  One product card, shared by the homepage grid, the collection page, the
  related row and the launch band. Shared so they can never drift.

  The free shipping line appears only on a product whose own price clears the
  threshold. It is the one accent line on a card and it is checkable: buy that
  item by itself and the shipping really is free. Chewy runs the same line on
  the cards that qualify and leaves it off the ones that do not, which is what
  makes it worth reading.

  The struck price and the percentage are drawn from compare_at_price, so they
  appear only while a real discount exists on the product and disappear by
  themselves the day it is removed. Nothing here is typed by hand, which is the
  only way a sale price stays honest without somebody remembering to take it
  down.
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- liquid
  assign free_from = 19900
  assign ships_free = false
  if product.price >= free_from
    assign ships_free = true
  endif

  assign on_sale = false
  if product.compare_at_price > product.price
    assign on_sale = true
    comment
      Floored on purpose: a product at 30.04% off is shown as 30, never as 31.
      The floor is explicit rather than relying on integer division, because
      Shopify's divided_by floors two integers and other Liquid engines do not,
      and a percentage that renders as 30.093009 is how that difference shows
      up in public.
    endcomment
    assign off_pct = product.compare_at_price | minus: product.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: product.compare_at_price | floor
  endif
-%}

<a class="wf-card" href="{{ product.url }}">
  <div class="wf-card__frame">
    {%- if on_sale and off_pct > 0 -%}
      <span class="wf-card__off">-{{ off_pct }}%</span>
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if product.featured_image != blank -%}
      <img
        src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 700 }}"
        srcset="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 380 }} 380w, {{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 700 }} 700w"
        sizes="(max-width: 900px) 46vw, 23vw"
        width="{{ product.featured_image.width }}"
        height="{{ product.featured_image.height }}"
        alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | default: product.title | escape }}"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      >
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
  <p class="wf-card__name">{{ product.title }}</p>
  <p class="wf-card__price">
    {{ product.price | money }}
    {%- if on_sale -%}
      <s class="wf-card__was">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</s>
    {%- endif -%}
  </p>
  {%- if ships_free -%}
    <p class="wf-card__ship">משלוח חינם</p>
  {%- endif -%}
</a>
